    "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 169, Number 206 (Thursday, December 14, 2023)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Mr. FEENSTRA:\nH.R. 6806.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nArticle I, Section 8 of the US Constitution\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nThis bill provides for the establishment of a program to\ncertify artificial intelligence software used in connection\nwith producing agricultural products.\n[Page H6987]\n</pre>",
